      "updated_at": "2026-01-28T11:46:40Z",
      "body": "Afaik the problem is that \"save current time\" is saving out all chunks that are in the selection. Those chunks usually go much further in time and on small scenes you may end up with essentially just a single chunk per entity path.\n\nFeels like the feature is at the very least really incorrectly advertised, if not broken alltogether depending how you look at it: to function correctly, it should truncate all chunks in the range.",
