      "updated_at": "2026-01-28T14:06:29Z",
      "body": "> Afaik the problem is that \"save current time\" is saving out all chunks that are in the selection.\n\nIndeed. And that would explain the behavior I got on my real data:\n\n> I also experienced cases where saving a time range like [t0;t1] in the end saves a range like [t0-a ; t1+b] (and `a` and `b` is different for each stream).\n\nand explain why I was not able to reproduce it with the dummy example where the data is not big enough to have more than one chunk.",
