      "created_at": "2026-02-03T14:47:08Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-02-03T14:47:08Z",
      "body": "FYI, I was able to workaround this issue with `export RERUN_CHUNK_MAX_ROWS=1` before starting `rerun`.\nWhen I do \"save the current time selection\", the resulting `.rrd` is as expected.\n\nOptionally, one can run `rerun rrd compact data_max_row_1.rrd > data.rrd` to get back the default chunking mechanism",
